# Ordered manifest of local/* branches for the sync cycle.
# rebuild-local-dev.sh merges these in listed order.
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Ordering rationale:
#   - foundational/infra patches first (cancel, subagent, watchdog, tool, provider)
#   - compaction stack as a sequential block (intra-stack dependencies)
#   - features in the middle (skill-preamble, tui-navigation)
#   - docs/misc last (least likely to conflict)
#
# Cross-branch dependencies (surfaced by 2026-04-27 catch-up Phase 1):
#   - local/compaction-todo depends on local/compaction-agent-identity
#     (consumes its buildIdentityReinforcement helper)
#   - local/compaction-thinking-signature depends on the post-conversion
#     loop owned by the compaction stack (.filter extends a loop those
#     branches own / re-establish on the new upstream shape)
#   - local/compaction-todo's watchdog/spawn.ts edits depend on
#     local/intelligent-session-watchdog being in place
#
# CLEAN-vs-MANUAL verdicts (Phase 1 of 2026-04-27 catch-up) are recorded
# in specs/2026-04-27-upstream-catchup/plans/local-<name>.md and the
# bd epic opencode-dby.

